# Cursor agent rules

Follow AGENTS.md as the canonical guide and read DESIGN_SYSTEM.md before UI changes.

Retain these starter conventions:
- TypeScript for configuration; declarative, focused Astro components.
- Semantic HTML, reusable components, consistent responsive spacing.
- Content changes belong in src/config/site.ts.
- Check configuration changes before adding components or dependencies.
- Prefer native static implementations; avoid unnecessary abstraction and React.
- Empty optional data must render honestly without broken social/resume links.

Run npm run validate, npm run build, and npm run verify:build after modifications.
